WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.800
The Parliamentary Budget Officer estimates between twenty and twenty-six billion dollars in federal taxes go uncollected every year — roughly equivalent to the entire annual federal health transfer.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.034
CRA recovers just two point two billion.

00:00:14.034 --> 00:00:18.318
The offshore prosecution rate is less than zero point one percent.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:23.886
Meanwhile, CRA audits small businesses at three times the rate of major corporations.

00:00:23.886 --> 00:00:27.522
Our grandfathers paid their taxes and built this country.

00:00:27.522 --> 00:00:34.624
Now the ultra-wealthy hide billions offshore while CRA audits working families for five hundred dollar home-office deductions.
